%N A322255 Irregular triangle T(n,k), n >= 2, 1 <= k <= floor(n/2), read by rows, where T(n,k) is the number of permutations p of [n] such that |p(i)-p(i-1)| >= k for all i = 2..n.
%F A322255 T(n,k) = Sum_{j=k..floor(n/2)} A129534(n,j). - _Alois P. Heinz_, May 20 2023
